&lt;p&gt;Conclusion&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If you’re building AI apps today:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Deployment is NOT optional&lt;br&gt;
Architecture matters more than UI&lt;br&gt;
Cloud knowledge = unfair advantage&lt;/p&gt;




